SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 20 - There's a Grave Waiting
 Somewhere for Every Outlaw
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan returns as our Red Dead Redemption II journey
 reaches Episode 20. The world is changing, the law is never far behind,
 and life as an outlaw comes with the uncomfortable knowledge that every
 road eventually reaches its end. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang
 are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on
 their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight their way across the
 rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VEZnm2Nl_Rs
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
