SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 84 - High Spirits (1988)
DESCRIPTION:After surviving unreliable public transport, Arrakis, frontier
 diseases, magical forests, outlaw trouble, and literal gates to Hell, it's
 time to get comfortable and enjoy another relaxed Movie Night with the
 community. Meet you all on Discord for Movie Night.
