SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 47 - Nearly Ready for Tea, Toilets
 and Questionable Sausage Rolls
DESCRIPTION:Our magnificent service area is getting dangerously close to
 completion. Soon weary travellers will finally have somewhere to enjoy a
 cup of tea, visit the facilities, and spend an unreasonable amount of
 money on a sausage roll that's been under a heat lamp since Tuesday.
 Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever! Take charge
 of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the franchise, and build
 to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your own or with your
 friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SBHdTz3vS9E
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
