SUMMARY:Permafrost | Ep. 1 - Endless Winter? Right, I'll Put the Kettle On
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new survival adventure begins! The world may be
 frozen, civilisation may have collapsed, and survival may depend on
 gathering every resource we can find - but before dealing with any of
 that, we're putting the kettle on. Priorities. The world has been plunged
 into an endless winter, and surviving the cold is only the beginning. As a
 Rook-an engineer drawn into the frozen wasteland by a radio signal from a
 long-lost friend-we'll explore abandoned cities and wilderness, scavenge
 desperately needed supplies, craft equipment, repair technology and build
 a network of shelters. With brutal weather, dangerous factions and scarce
 resources standing in our way, we'll need to prepare carefully for every
 journey. At least we won't be completely alone, with a loyal dog companion
 helping us scout for danger and carry supplies as we uncover the story of
 this frozen post-apocalyptic world.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vAPlYs_Fse8
CATEGORIES:Permafrost
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24752211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260916T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T014300Z
DTSTART:20261007T203000Z
DTEND:20261007T223000Z
SUMMARY:Edge Of Evil | Ep. 2 - Mittens! Stop Making Friends With the
 Eldritch Horrors!
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back into the supernatural nightmare of Edge Of
 Evil, and Mittens apparently hasn't learned anything. Strange noises?
 Ancient entities? Unspeakable horrors from beyond our understanding? To a
 cat, that's just three potential new friends. Descend into a dark
 psychological horror adventure where the search for a lost kitten leads
 deep into an ancient pirate crypt. Explore hidden passages, disturb
 forgotten graves, solve cryptic puzzles, dig for clues and treasure, and
 defend yourself from undead shadow creatures lurking below. With an eerie
 atmosphere, immersive sound, fully voiced characters and a mystery
 surrounding a broken ancient seal, this is a journey where curiosity may
 take us far deeper than we ever intended.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=73ZKYJdvOgo
CATEGORIES:Edge Of Evil
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
