SUMMARY:Sim City (1991) SNES | Ep. 1 - Residential, Commercial,
 Industrial... Pub?
DESCRIPTION:We're going retro! Tonight we're firing up the SNES version of
 Sim City and attempting to build a thriving metropolis using sensible
 urban planning. Residential zones? Yes. Commercial districts? Absolutely.
 Industrial areas? Obviously. Pub? Surely that's essential infrastructure.
 It's time to become mayor and build a city from the ground up in the
 classic SNES version of SimCity! We'll zone residential, commercial and
 industrial areas, build roads and essential services, manage the city
 budget and try to keep our growing population happy. From traffic problems
 and rising crime to fires and unexpected disasters, there's always
 something demanding the mayor's attention. Can we transform an empty
 landscape into a thriving metropolis, or will our questionable city
 planning send everyone looking for somewhere better to live?
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Sim City
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
