SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 3 - Lovely Place,
 Shame About the Gates to Hell
DESCRIPTION:Back to beautiful Cyrodiil, where picturesque forests,
 historic cities, ancient ruins, and enormous flaming portals into Oblivion
 somehow coexist. Time to continue our adventure and investigate why nobody
 has considered putting up a few warning signs. Return to the province of
 Cyrodiil in a remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the
 Emperor slain and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll
 create our character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests,
 join factions, delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of
 Mehrunes Dagon. Whether we follow the main story or get completely
 distracted by side quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be
 rediscovered.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
