SUMMARY:A Christmas Party Before Halloween with Jade the Chocolate Thief
DESCRIPTION: Who says we have to wait until December to celebrate
 Christmas? Tonight, I'm taking a night off from streaming and heading out
 for a Christmas party... before Halloween has even arrived! Joining me for
 this slightly premature festive celebration is none other than Jade the
 Chocolate Thief! Expect plenty of laughs, festive cheer, good company and
 probably a little bit of chaos as we swap gaming for a night out. Will
 Jade manage to resist stealing all the Christmas chocolates? Somehow, I
 doubt it! There won't be a live stream tonight, but sometimes even Dr
 Ravenholm needs to step away from the games and enjoy a little festive fun!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Christmas Party Before Halloween with Jade the Chocolate Thief
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
